-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party / vendored components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

rust/vendor/libsqlite3-sys/
    A vendored copy of `libsqlite3-sys` (the FFI -sys crate behind rusqlite),
    Copyright the rusqlite developers, licensed under the MIT License (see
    rust/vendor/libsqlite3-sys/LICENSE). It is unmodified except that its bundled
    SQLite amalgamation (sqlite3/sqlite3.{c,h}, sqlite3ext.h) is replaced with a
    bedrock-branch SQLite 3.54.0 amalgamation (wal2 + BEGIN CONCURRENT; see
    docs/SQLITE_WAL2.md in the upstream monorepo). It is wired in via [patch.crates-io] in
    rust/Cargo.toml so every SQLite-linking crate links bedrock.

rust/vendor/libsqlite3-sys/sqlite3/sqlite3.{c,h}, sqlite3ext.h
    SQLite (https://sqlite.org), bedrock branch (wal2 + BEGIN CONCURRENT),
    version 3.54.0. SQLite is in the public domain. Generated with the
    zero-sqlite3 production define set; see scripts/regen-bedrock-amalgamation.sh
    (in the upstream monorepo).
